{"title":"Mossback","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Mossback is a named <a href=\"#/monster/giant-spider\">Giant Spider</a> seen at level 22.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Mossback</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"mossback\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ancient-moss\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d586c8d80dfb5cdeac77.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ancient Moss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">7 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shell-stone\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c64481875084d7ec0d03.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shell Stone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"living-moss\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0a59352953e2cefa4996.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Living Moss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"spider-silk\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0b2636b90d57ad14912f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spider Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"spider-friend-mossback-clutch\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/80d997b766f4783a2bf8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spider Friend Mossback Clutch</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"heartstone\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2f686f4db776b0c92b03.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Heartstone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Giant Spiders</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/nest-spider\">Nest Spider</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/loom-nest-spider\">Loom Nest Spider</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/tessa-s-wolf-spider\">Tessa&#39;s Wolf Spider</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/mother-sallow\">Mother Sallow</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/18a260cc427b201aa0b5.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Mossback</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/giant-spider\">Giant Spider</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>22</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>74</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}